  "notes": "Deploy ledger fully before deploying the CHG-103 customer release. New ledger instances accept both legacy requestId-only posts and idempotencyKey posts, so old customer instances can run alongside new ledger instances. The customer release must not send retries that depend on idempotency keys until ledger is fully deployed. No drain or atomic switch is required."
